{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"\"Can you take memories away? Replace them?\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T23:58:40.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737458972931391610","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"\"I have met them once. I am as like them as any I suppose?\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T23:58:40.926000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737458974835867698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"<@!692746345387130900> \"My own, perhaps. I have not tried to do such to another. Seems a particularly bad form of stealing if done without consent.\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T23:59:37.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737459213755744327","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"\"I mean, Amara has dreams that are memories too. And she can speak through minds like you do.\"","created_at":"2020-07-27T23:59:45.546000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737459245871530074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"\"I am certainly not the only one who can do this. I suspect there are many more.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T00:00:31.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737459440705601726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"Skitter ponders and listens.","created_at":"2020-07-28T00:00:36.985000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737459461622595635","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"Web nods at Fabertell. \"Can you speak quori then?\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T00:01:16.385000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737459626877911092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"715342330978238475","content":"\"I met one once while working, they worked for a lord and they tried to tell me what they thought about it and showed they could do it as well. When I told them my ideas about it they said I was a 'Scattered old bat,' they got upset and stormed off.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T00:02:09.985000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737459851692867677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
